<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=892" title="View the profile of Fernis">Fernis</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Guild Leader<br />
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 14<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.dawningnemesis.com/images/avatars/ferniss.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Leader of Dawning Nemesis<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=892"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.nemesisguild.com" title="Dawning Nemesis" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1192.msg11878#msg11878"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1192.msg11878#msg11878">Dawning Nemesis *New Focus*</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> October 19, 2004, 11:32:01 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							A Warm Hello to All,<br /><br /><b>Thanks to the wonderful players that have joined DN and their hard work we have shifted our focus as a guild and have become more &quot;Raid&quot; oriented.</b> We currently raid at least 5 nights a week. We raid 8pm EST Wed, Fri, Sat, and Sun is set aside for epic 1.5 raid encounters. There is also a chance of a random raid being called during non scheduled raid days to ease the pressure of back flagging.<br /><br /><b>DN is now Officially an &quot;Time Flagged Guild&quot;</b> <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cool.gif" alt="Cool" border="0" /><br /><br /><b>Applications are Closed</b><br /><br />If you have any questions feel free to contact me (Ferniss) or one of the officers Plinko, Siduri, Lafaye or Gopix in game. <br />You can also visit our website at <a href="http://www.dawningnemesis.com" target="_blank">http://www.dawningnemesis.com</a>
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: April 07, 2005, 02:32:12 pm by Fernis</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=815538" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.dawningnemesis.com/images/signatures/ferniss.jpg" alt="" border="0" /></a><br /><br /><a href="http://www.dawningnemesis.com" target="_blank">Dawning Nemesis Web Site Link</a>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg11881"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
