							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1192.msg11881#msg11881"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1192.msg11881#msg11881">Re: Dawning Nemesis *New Guild*</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #1 on:</b> October 19, 2004, 01:55:26 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							awww Ferniss...Miss ya already !!!<br /><br />If you are looking for a fun group of people to just hang around with, you couldnt pick very many more fun than Ferniss.&nbsp; Good luck with your new adventure hun !!<br /><br />HUGS!!<br /><br /> <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/aktion031.gif" alt="aktion031" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
