								<a href="http://www.nemesisguild.com" title="Dawning Nemesis" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1192.msg11922#msg11922"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1192.msg11922#msg11922">Re: Dawning Nemesis *New Guild*</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2 on:</b> October 21, 2004, 10:04:55 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							We are currently accepting applications from all classes.<br /><br />We have a min lvl requirement of 65.<br /><br />Drama Queens need not apply!<br /><br />Contact Ferniss, Plinko, Jeran, Baelnom or Prodigy in the game with any questions.<br /><br /><a href="http://www.dawningnemesis.com" target="_blank">http://www.dawningnemesis.com</a>
