	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg13680"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=892" title="View the profile of Fernis">Fernis</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Guild Leader<br />
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 14<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.dawningnemesis.com/images/avatars/ferniss.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Leader of Dawning Nemesis<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=892"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.nemesisguild.com" title="Dawning Nemesis" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1192.msg13680#msg13680"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1192.msg13680#msg13680">Re: Dawning Nemesis *New Focus*</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #6 on:</b> January 13, 2005, 10:09:02 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<b>If you are interested in joining us and need the flags now is the time to apply, because after this pass it may be a couple months before we make another full PoP flagging run.</b><br /><br />As a side note <b>DN has completed our first 1.5 Epic</b>. Grats to Sikar (70 Bst). More will be coming in the near future as we now have a suitably sized and wonderfully skilled raid force. I will make a page on the web site listing the new epics as we get them.<br /><br /><br />As always if you have any questions please contact me (Ferniss) or one of the officers Baelnom, Jeran, Plinko, Prodigy or Docevill in game.<br /><br />You can also visit our website at <a href="http://www.dawningnemesis.com" target="_blank">http://www.dawningnemesis.com</a>
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: January 23, 2005, 11:42:47 am by Fernis</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=815538" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.dawningnemesis.com/images/signatures/ferniss.jpg" alt="" border="0" /></a><br /><br /><a href="http://www.dawningnemesis.com" target="_blank">Dawning Nemesis Web Site Link</a>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
